Na Ja Tu Guitar Chords easy lesson sang by Dhvani Bhanushali.

[Dm] [A#] [F] [Am]

Na ja tu [Dm]door ankhiyon [A#]se,        Ki nai [F]jaana, nahi [Am]jaana
Ke toot [Dm]jaaun main,        Dil se [A#]door
Tu nahi [F]jaana, nahi [Am]jaana

Kya [Dm]hai ab tere baad mera,        Tu [A#]milna paya pyar tera
Tu [F]raha na jo yaar mera,        Haan [Am]pyar mera

Tujhe [Dm]kadar nahi ek baar meri,        Jo [A#]maine ki har baar teri
Ro [F]ro ke thak gayi ankhiyan meri,        Mere [Am]yaar na ja

[Dm]Ni [A#]mere [F]yaar [C]na ja

[Dm] [A#]

[Dm]Subah se shaam tak,        [A#]Dekha tujhe
Soun [F]nahi, soun [Am]nahi,        Haan mere [Dm]paas hi
Reh [A#]jao na,        Yahin [F]kahin, yahin [Am]kahin

Main ho [Dm]gayi hoon,        Khud se be [A#]khabar
Khoya maine [F]sabar,        Yeh tera hi [Am]asar

Tere [Dm]liye,        Bhooli main yeh [A#]jahaan
Na jaane tu [F]kahan,        Gaya oh [C]humsafar
[Am]Yaar na ja

[Dm] [A#] [F] [C]

Tu rok [Dm]na mujhe,        Hai [A#]jeena tujhe
Mujhse [F]juda,        Mujhse [Am]juda

Tujhse [Dm]nahi hoon main,        Main to [A#]khud se hi
Hoon [F]khafa,        Main hoon [Am]khafa

Tutega [Dm]dil,        Na kabhi aisa [A#]kar
Jo kiya tu [F]agar,        Main jaungi [Am]bikhar

Tere [Dm]bina,        Kya mera hai [A#]yahan
Tujhi mein hai [F]jahaan,        Kyun hai tu be [C]khabar
Ni mere [Am]yaar na ja

[Dm]Nahi [A#]jaana [F] [Am]
